    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d120-a3">

                <pb facs="0311" n="301" sameAs="frus:frus1864p1/pg301"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 4 in No. 23. ]</seg></opener>
                <head>Consul Archibald to Lord Lyons.</head>

                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New York,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-02-04"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 4, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I think it sufficient to notify the government that Shephard is here. He will
                    attend and give evidence if required on receiving a summons for that purpose</p>
            </div>
        </body>
